  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 9th level, the bravo can use his careful footwork ability as an immediate action instead of a swift action. If used to avoid an attack or area effect, he still has a chance to be affected but this movement grants him a dodge bonus to AC and Reflex saves equal to 1/2 his bravo level.</p>\n<p>Additionally, when the bravo rolls initiative and is not surprised, he can take a 5-foot step as part of rolling initiative.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bravo#toc15\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
